  "content": {
    "id": "p30-q25-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Find the exact value of the following if $\\sin\\theta=\\frac35$ and $\\theta$ is acute.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p30-q25-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sin2\\theta$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{24}{25}$",
          "worked": "Since $\\theta$ is acute, $\\cos\\theta>0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\theta&=\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\frac35\\right)^2}\\\\\\cos\\theta&=\\frac45\\\\\\sin2\\theta&=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\\\\\sin2\\theta&=2\\left(\\frac35\\right)\\left(\\frac45\\right)\\\\\\sin2\\theta&=\\frac{24}{25}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 64
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q25-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\cos2\\theta$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac7{25}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos2\\theta&=1-2\\sin^2\\theta\\\\\\cos2\\theta&=1-2\\left(\\frac35\\right)^2\\\\\\cos2\\theta&=\\frac7{25}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q25-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\tan2\\theta$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{24}{7}$",
          "worked": "Using parts (a) and (b):\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan2\\theta&=\\frac{\\sin2\\theta}{\\cos2\\theta}\\\\\\tan2\\theta&=\\frac{\\frac{24}{25}}{\\frac7{25}}\\\\\\tan2\\theta&=\\frac{24}{7}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      }
    ]
  },
